You forgot to implement Display for your custom error.

**The fix:**
```rust
impl fmt::Display for MyError {
    fn fmt(&self, f: &mut fmt::Formatter<'_>) -> fmt::Result {
        write!(f, "{}", self.message)
    }
}
```

**Rust-chan says:**
"Errors should implement Display for user-friendly messages."
